From 20faa43e0b70a5d9ab8105cc18b5f3abeb939dcd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emmanuel Kimathi <kimathi@example.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 19:12:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add missing argon2-cffi dependency for Argon2PasswordHasher

PASSWORD_HASHERS lists Argon2PasswordHasher first, but argon2-cffi
was never added to requirements.txt, so create_admin failed with
ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'argon2' as soon as it tried
to hash the superuser's password.
---
 requirements.txt | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/requirements.txt b/requirements.txt
index 9fbc00f..b25e95d 100644
--- a/requirements.txt
+++ b/requirements.txt
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@ dj-database-url==3.1.2
 psycopg[binary]==3.3.4
 whitenoise[brotli]==6.9.0
 python-dotenv==1.0.1
+argon2-cffi==25.1.0
 pandas==2.3.3
 openpyxl==3.1.5
 pdfplumber==0.11.4
-- 
2.43.0

